{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Ani"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"生象的范畴"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"<p>生象的范畴 $\\mathsf{Ani}$ 是最基本的 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Ani}$ 是一个点在"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":"下自由生成的范畴.</p>\n<h3>带基点对象</h3>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Ani}$ 的终对象 $*$ 下的"},{"Local":{"url":"仰范畴","text":"仰范畴"}},{"Plain":"称为<strong>带基点生象</strong>的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani_pt","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}_*$"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>识别</h3>\n<p>如何证明一个范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 等价于 $\\mathsf{Ani}$?</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 设范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 余完备, 有函子 $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathsf{Ani}$ 以及对象 $*\\in \\mathcal C$ 满足\n$$\nf(*)=*,\\quad f\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}(*,-),\n$$\n则 $f$ 为等价, 且其逆为\n$$\n\\mathsf{Ani}\\to\\mathcal C,\\quad X\\mapsto\\operatorname{colim}_X *.\n$$</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>. 由"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随函子定理","text":"伴随函子定理"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n"}]}}